# Game Flowchart — The Whispering Wilds

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([Launch Game]) --> Boot[00_Boot Scene]
    Boot --> Intro{Cinematic Intro?}
    
    Intro -->|Yes| IntroPlay[Play 7s Intro<br/>Title + Subtitle + Skip]
    Intro -->|No/Disabled| MainMenu[Main Menu]
    
    IntroPlay --> Skip{Skip?}
    Skip -->|Any Key| MainMenu
    Skip -->|7s Complete| MainMenu
    
    MainMenu --> Login[Login/Account]
    MainMenu --> NewGame[New Game]
    MainMenu --> Continue{Continue?}
    MainMenu --> Settings[Settings - 6 Tabs]
    MainMenu --> Quit([Quit])
    
    Login --> LoginPanel[Login Panel]
    LoginPanel -->|Sign In| AuthService[AuthService → /api/auth/login]
    LoginPanel -->|Register| AuthRegister[AuthService → /api/auth/register]
    LoginPanel -->|Back| MainMenu
    
    AuthService -->|Success| SignedIn[Show Signed In]
    AuthService -->|Fail| LoginError[Show Error]
    SignedIn --> MainMenu
    
    Continue -->|Save Exists| LoadSave[Load Saved Game]
    Continue -->|No Save| ContinueDisabled[Button Disabled]
    
    NewGame --> ResetCampaign[CampaignFlow.ResetCampaign]
    ResetCampaign --> LoadChennai[Load 02_Chennai_GeorgeTown]
    LoadChennai --> SpawnPlayer[Spawn Player]
    
    SpawnPlayer --> PlayerControls[Player Movement + Camera]
    PlayerControls --> Interact{Interact?}
    
    Interact -->|NPC| NPCDialogue[NPCCharacter → DialogueUI]
    Interact -->|Clue| ClueDiscovery[GameplayEventInteractable<br/>→ InvestigationManager]
    Interact -->|Vendor| VendorTrade[NPCCharacter → VendorUI]
    Interact -->|Item| PickupItem[InventoryManager.Add]
    
    NPCDialogue -->|Choice → Clue| ClueDiscovery
    ClueDiscovery --> UpdateQuest[QuestManager Advance]
    UpdateQuest --> CheckUnlock{Region Unlock?}
    
    CheckUnlock -->|Yes| UnlockRegion[RegionUnlockManager.Unlock]
    CheckUnlock -->|No| ContinuePlay[Continue Playing]
    
    UnlockRegion --> TravelMap[01_StateMap_TamilNadu]
    TravelMap --> SelectRegion{Select Region}
    
    SelectRegion -->|Pichavaram| Pichavaram[03_Pichavaram_Wetlands]
    SelectRegion -->|Thanjavur| Thanjavur[04_Thanjavur_Delta]
    SelectRegion -->|Chettinad| Chettinad[05_Chettinad_Mansion]
    SelectRegion -->|Mamallapuram| Mamallapuram[06_Mamallapuram_Shore]
    SelectRegion -->|Nilgiris| Nilgiris[07_Nilgiris_Sanctuary]
    
    Pichavaram --> CluePichavaram[Discover Clues]
    Thanjavur --> ClueThanjavur[Discover Clues]
    Chettinad --> ClueChettinad[Discover Clues]
    Mamallapuram --> ClueMamallapuram[Discover Clues]
    Nilgiris --> ClueNilgiris[Discover Final Clues]
    
    CluePichavaram --> SaveGame{Save?}
    ClueThanjavur --> SaveGame
    ClueChettinad --> SaveGame
    ClueMamallapuram --> SaveGame
    ClueNilgiris --> EndingCheck{All Clues?}
    
    SaveGame -->|Yes| SaveSystem[SaveSystem.SaveGame]
    SaveGame -->|No| ContinuePlay
    
    SaveSystem --> LocalSave[(Local Save File)]
    SaveSystem -->|If Configured| CloudSave[CloudSaveManager → /api/v1/persistence]
    CloudSave -->|No Config| LocalSave
    CloudSave -->|Success| CloudSaved[(Cloud Save)]
    
    EndingCheck -->|Yes| EndingController[EndingController.Evaluate]
    EndingCheck -->|No| ContinuePlay
    
    EndingController --> EndingDisplay[Show Ending]
    EndingDisplay --> ReturnMenu[Return to Main Menu]
    
    ReturnMenu --> MainMenu
    ContinuePlay --> Interact
    
    classDef green fill:#90EE90,stroke:#228B22,stroke-width:2px
    classDef yellow fill:#FFFF90,stroke:#DAA520,stroke-width:2px
    classDef red fill:#FFB6C1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px
    
    class Boot,IntroPlay,Skip,MainMenu,LoginPanel,NewGame,ResetCampaign,LoadChennai,SpawnPlayer,PlayerControls,NPCDialogue,ClueDiscovery,VendorTrade,PickupItem,UpdateQuest,UnlockRegion,TravelMap,SelectRegion,Pichavaram,Thanjavur,Chettinad,Mamallapuram,Nilgiris,CluePichavaram,ClueThanjavur,ClueChettinad,ClueMamallapuram,ClueNilgiris,SaveSystem,LocalSave,EndingController,EndingDisplay,ReturnMenu,ContinuePlay,Interact,CheckUnlock,SaveGame,Settings,Quit,AuthService,AuthRegister,SignedIn,LoginError,LoadSave,ContinueDisabled green
    class CloudSave,CloudSaved yellow
```

**Legend:**
- 🟢 Green = Working and verified
- 🟡 Yellow = Code exists but not fully integrated (cloud saves need Configure() call)
- 🔴 Red = Missing implementation (multiplayer client)
